| Change the inspection branch on an open order | Yes | Yes | No | No | No |
| Cancel an order | Yes | Yes | No | No | No |
| Freeze an order during a dispute | Yes | Yes | No | No | No |
| Enter an inspection result | Yes | No | No | No | Yes |
| Confirm handover at the counter | Yes | No | No | No | Yes |
| Confirm handover of a returned piece to the seller | Yes | No | No | No | Yes |
| Check the ID of someone collecting for another person | No | No | No | No | Yes |

